abstract: >-
  Open datasets for AI products, rankings, research and evidence published
  by Harpd. Includes an AI product catalog (1,122 products), Harpd Rank
  overall/monthly/weekly boards, an AI Market Index, AI Agent / Developer
  Tools / AI Tools indices derived from the Harpd Product Discovery Index,
  published research families and evidence-linked ranking claims. All data
  is mirrored from harpd.com and attributed to Harpd under CC BY 4.0.
